<section class="feature-list-section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p>
      Most teams end up with their docs in one app, their tasks in another,
      and their calendar in a third — syncing between them by hand whenever
      something changes. Inertia exists to put all three in one workspace
      instead: a document, the tasks that came out of it, and the dates
      they're due, all in the same place, updating in real time as a team
      works.
    </p>
    <p>
      It's built to be used wherever work happens — on the web, as a native
      Mac app, or on iOS — without being a second product with its own
      quirks.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

